      "text": "[6:14PM] #PWD #TrafficUpdate \n\nHeavy traffic congestion inward route from National towards Ajayi Farm via PWD, resulting from a minor accident at Ikeja Flyover, which has recently been cleared.\nSmooth movement on the stretch from Ajayi Farm to Mongoro, Cement, and down to Dopemu Underneath the Bridge.\nBuilding up of traffic approaching Dopemu Bridge.\n\nGood traffic flow on the return journey from Dopemu Underneath the Bridge back to Ikeja, including Bolade Junction on the return route to PWD.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
