    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1930683902605090915",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1930683902605090915",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1930683902605090915",
      "text": "[6:47PM] #Agege #TrafficUpdate \n\nBusy movement on Oba Akran from Dangote U-Turn inward to Mobil Ashade and down to Akilo, due to influx of return journey traffic.\nCongested traffic on Ijaye Road, both inward and outward, from Odo Eran to Oba Ogunji, resulting from traffic alternation and evening rush hour.\nBusy traffic flow at Fumec inward Acme Junction and down to Metal Box, attributed to return journey influx.\nFast-paced movement at Guinness inward Akanni Doherty, connecting to Mangoro Ashade, although Ashade is experiencing busy traffic due to traffic light alternation.\nBusy traffic on Capitol Road inward Oniwaya Junction, due to alternation, while Alfa Nla to Okekoto is moving at a fast pace.\nBusy movement on Okekoto inward Shofunde Agbotikuyo, due to alternation, while Olufunlayo to NYSC is moving at a fast pace.\nBusy traffic on Isokoko inward Total Underneath the Bridge, resulting from alternation and commuter activities, while Nitel to Oko Oba is moving at a fast pace, and Abattoir is experiencing busy traffic due to alternation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
